  "notes": "Kirby validation suite: 43 recordings across all six supported stages, with 42 exact and one missing-raw-C-stick classification on both native and PPC. The 26 corpus games cover Zelda, Ice Climbers, Game & Watch, Falco, Marth, Captain Falcon, Peach and a level-6 CPU Bowser. The 17 scripted captures use the pinned accurate-nmsub Dolphin build and exercise copied neutral specials, hat acquisition/loss, Final Cutter, Hammer and Stone. Individual recordings do not establish every move branch or every copy ability. Native smoke additionally exercises Pichu inhale/jolt, Roy ground/air charge selection, Game & Watch inhale/Chef, multiple costume hats, copy/save/restore and sealed allocation. The original Pichu/Roy scratch recordings were unavailable at integration. The D20 #1 Falco classification records a missing required raw C-stick input. Existing capture eligibility, including console magnifier and live Stadium configuration, will be audited in the separately authorized post-integration policy cleanup. Provenance and unresolved unadmitted recordings: agent_docs/validation/kirby_provenance.json.",
